- Added `initialLoading` state (700ms presentation window) triggering `<ProductLandingSkeleton />` immediately upon route mount or slug transition.
- Implemented `imgLoaded` state with smooth opacity transition (`duration-700`) and `.skeleton-shimmer` placeholder in the hero photo container.
- Wrapped standalone page in Framer Motion fade-in (`motion.div` with `opacity: 0 -> 1`).

